Choose the initial pressure level. The hard version begins with fewer resources,
more factional distrust and a public already doubtful that the alliance can
last.

- @standard: A precarious but recoverable alliance
- @hard: Red autumn — everyone has a knife
- @formation_standard: Enter the October 2023 transfer of power
- @cancel: Return to the title

@standard
title: A precarious but recoverable alliance
view-if: formation_requested = 0
go-to: poland_intro

@hard
title: Red autumn — everyone has a knife
view-if: formation_requested = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.hard_mode = 1;
Q.difficulty_name = "Red autumn";
Q.resources = 3;
Q.member_dues = 1;
Q.party_income = Q.member_dues + Q.seat_subvention;
Q.party_unity = 49;
Q.left_poll = 11.8;
Q.barons_dissent += 8;
Q.razem_dissent += 10;
Q.spring_dissent += 5;
Q.ko_relation -= 5;
Q.psl_relation -= 5;
Q.media_capacity -= 3;
Q.far_right_agenda += 6;
!}
go-to: poland_intro

@formation_standard
title: Enter the October 2023 transfer of power
view-if: formation_requested = 1
go-to: poland_government_formation.setup

@cancel
on-arrival: started = 0
go-to: start_menu
